    },
    "Estimated by AI from your description, which is sent to Google's AI service for analysis and isn't stored by Compound. Try naming each food and its amount, such as \"2 eggs and a slice of toast.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Estimado por IA a partir de tu descripción, que se envía al servicio de IA de Google para su análisis y Compound no la almacena. Prueba a nombrar cada alimento y su cantidad, por ejemplo «2 huevos y una rebanada de pan tostado»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Estimated by AI from your photo. The photo is sent to Google's AI service for analysis and isn't stored by Compound." : {
